$ nexoctl admin tier ls mem
"mem" has no tier.

$ nexoctl admin tier add mem COLD archive/cold-data --prefix nexo/
Tier COLD added: https://archive.example.test/cold-data/nexo.

$ nexoctl admin tier add mem WARM archive/warm --storage-class STANDARD_IA
Tier WARM added: https://archive.example.test/warm.

$ nexoctl admin tier ls mem
NAME             ENDPOINT                                 BUCKET                   CLASS          ACCESS KEY
COLD             https://archive.example.test             cold-data/nexo           -              ARCHKEY
WARM             https://archive.example.test             warm                     STANDARD_IA    ARCHKEY

$ nexoctl admin tier ls --json mem
{"status":"success","alias":"mem","name":"COLD","endpoint":"https://archive.example.test","bucket":"cold-data","prefix":"nexo/","accessKey":"ARCHKEY","created":"2026-01-02T03:04:05Z","updated":"2026-01-02T03:04:05Z"}
{"status":"success","alias":"mem","name":"WARM","endpoint":"https://archive.example.test","bucket":"warm","storageClass":"STANDARD_IA","accessKey":"ARCHKEY","created":"2026-01-02T03:04:05Z","updated":"2026-01-02T03:04:05Z"}

$ nexoctl admin tier edit mem COLD archive2
Credentials of tier COLD replaced.

$ nexoctl mb mem/app
Bucket created successfully `mem/app`.

$ nexoctl ilm rule add --id cold --prefix logs/ --transition-days 30 --transition-tier COLD --noncurrent-transition-days 7 mem/app
Lifecycle rule "cold" added to `mem/app`.

$ nexoctl ilm rule edit --id cold --transition-days -1 mem/app
Lifecycle rule "cold" of `mem/app` updated.

$ nexoctl ilm rule ls mem/app
ID               STATUS   FILTER                         ACTIONS
cold             Enabled  prefix=logs/                   noncurrent transition to COLD after 7d

$ nexoctl ilm rule add --transition-days 30 mem/app
! nexoctl: error: --transition-days needs a --transition-tier
! Run 'nexoctl ilm rule add --help' for usage.
[exit 2]

$ nexoctl admin tier add mem cold archive/x
! nexoctl: error: invalid argument: invalid tier name "cold": upper case letters, digits, '-' and '_' only (invalid_argument)
[exit 1]

$ nexoctl admin tier add mem COLD archive/cold-data
! nexoctl: error: conflict: tier COLD exists (conflict)
[exit 1]

$ nexoctl admin tier add mem OTHER archive
! nexoctl: error: archive: a bucket is required (ALIAS/BUCKET)
! Run 'nexoctl admin tier add --help' for usage.
[exit 2]

$ nexoctl admin tier add mem OTHER ghost/bucket
! nexoctl: error: unknown alias "ghost" in "ghost/bucket" (remote locations are ALIAS/BUCKET[/PREFIX], see "nexoctl alias list")
[exit 3]

$ nexoctl admin tier edit mem NOPE archive2
! nexoctl: error: not found: tier NOPE (not_found)
[exit 3]

$ nexoctl admin tier rm mem COLD
! nexoctl: error: conflict: tier COLD holds the data of transitioned versions: bring them back or delete them first (conflict)
[exit 1]

$ nexoctl admin tier rm mem WARM
Tier WARM removed.

$ nexoctl admin tier rm mem WARM
! nexoctl: error: not found: tier WARM (not_found)
[exit 3]

$ nexoctl admin tier ls mem
NAME             ENDPOINT                                 BUCKET                   CLASS          ACCESS KEY
COLD             https://archive.example.test             cold-data/nexo           -              ARCHKEY2

